Description: local coding agent CLI from OpenAI
 Codex is a local coding assistant that runs from the terminal and works
 directly against a checked out repository.
 .
 This Debian package installs the `codex` CLI and relies on system-provided
 Git, ripgrep, and bubblewrap at runtime.
